{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix my charts! Pocket Boss is a data-bending remote career simulator. Master the pleasures of manipulating data while getting things done for your boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by Mario von Rickenbach (PLUG &amp; PLAY, KIDS), based on an idea by Maja Gehrig, with sound by Luc Gut.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Pocket Boss?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix this, change that! In Pocket Boss, you're a remote worker manipulating business charts for your boss: Increase productivity, boost customer satisfaction, make losses disappear, erase competitors \u2013 with just a finger swipe. Adjust, stretch and bend all kinds of charts until everyone is satisfied. Find convincing solutions for increasingly lively data puzzles, while dealing with your boss's whims and wishes. You have one week to prove you\u2019re ready for the promotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expected playtime 30-60 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509180/extras/c1f3c5d7b4f9a34d9c02f2eb8898b417.poster.avif?t=1757504559\" width=420 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509180/extras/c1f3c5d7b4f9a34d9c02f2eb8898b417.webm?t=1757504559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509180/extras/c1f3c5d7b4f9a34d9c02f2eb8898b417.mp4?t=1757504559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix puzzling charts, bend the trends. Productivity, shareholder value, customer trust \u2013 it all depends on your skill to make them shine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pie charts, bar charts, scatter plots: drag, pinch, pull and push all kinds of charts to make them behave while your boss pushes for results.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have awkward chats with your boss. Will it impact your promotion?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the mysteries of equal pay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3509180?t=1757504559","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509180/a69aed71af6cfbb3a040073678f8ef029c890954/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757504559","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509180/aa9b9d577a3917d45b076213cc6c865119356d81/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757504559","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509180/aa9b9d577a3917d45b076213cc6c865119356d81/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757504559","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix my charts! Pocket Boss is a data-bending remote career simulator. Master the pleasures of manipulating data while getting things done for your boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by Mario von Rickenbach (PLUG &amp; PLAY, KIDS), based on an idea by Maja Gehrig, with sound by Luc Gut.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Pocket Boss?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix this, change that! In Pocket Boss, you're a remote worker manipulating business charts for your boss: Increase productivity, boost customer satisfaction, make losses disappear, erase competitors \u2013 with just a finger swipe. Adjust, stretch and bend all kinds of charts until everyone is satisfied. Find convincing solutions for increasingly lively data puzzles, while dealing with your boss's whims and wishes. You have one week to prove you\u2019re ready for the promotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expected playtime 30-60 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509180/extras/c1f3c5d7b4f9a34d9c02f2eb8898b417.poster.avif?t=1757504559\" width=420 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509180/extras/c1f3c5d7b4f9a34d9c02f2eb8898b417.webm?t=1757504559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509180/extras/c1f3c5d7b4f9a34d9c02f2eb8898b417.mp4?t=1757504559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix puzzling charts, bend the trends. Productivity, shareholder value, customer trust \u2013 it all depends on your skill to make them shine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pie charts, bar charts, scatter plots: drag, pinch, pull and push all kinds of charts to make them behave while your boss pushes for results.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have awkward chats with your boss. Will it impact your promotion?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the mysteries of equal pay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Langfilm","Mario von Rickenbach"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509180/ac3af2d0ede1f00891deb07b19e983548089035a/header.jpg?t=175750455